// Date fields (signed_up_date/last_login_date/last_contacted_date) accept an ISO
// string, null, or an integer = that many days before the frozen TODAY (2026-06-12),
// so threshold boundaries read directly, e.g. "last_login_date": 21 == DORMANT_DAYS ago.

